+ * SQLite-backed Goal host (turn context, settlement and verifier dispatch).
+ *
+ * The hooks drive the same gate production composes in local-runtime-v2
+ * (`createGoalFinalReply`): its tool policy guard, first in the policy chain,
+ * refuses later tools by the agent run's context object; its extension records
+ * the accepted proposal on that object after each tool result and retries one
+ * empty response. Running through the real PiTurnRunner shows both hooks
